Name: buffer_trim
Signature: void buffer_trim(buffer_t *self)
Description: /**
 * @brief Removes leading and trailing whitespace from a buffer.
 *
 * Trims whitespace characters from both the beginning and end of the buffer,
 * modifying its contents in place. The buffer is updated to exclude any
 * leading or trailing spaces, tabs, or other standard whitespace.
 *
 * @param self Pointer to the buffer to trim. Must not be NULL. The buffer is
 *             modified in place; caller retains ownership.
 *
 * @return None.
 *
 * @note The buffer's contents and length may change after trimming.
 *
 * @see buffer_trim_left, buffer_trim_right
 */
Dependencies: buffer_trim_left, buffer_trim_right

